\* All TLC check configs for AntflyRepairCoverageRetry.tla.

==== positive tier=fast
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANT
    BuggyNameScopedCounter = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    IncompleteGenerationNeverActivates

PROPERTIES
    CoverageCatchUpEventuallyActivates

==== BadNameScopedCounter
\* A retired incarnation's name-scoped counter must not override the complete
\* current-generation outcome tuple during replacement activation.
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANT
    BuggyNameScopedCounter = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    IncompleteGenerationNeverActivates

PROPERTIES
    CoverageCatchUpEventuallyActivates
